  "description": "Enterprise-grade, extensible grid data component for .NET 8.0 applications.\n\t\t\tProvides dynamic metadata-driven grid configuration, server-side pagination,\n\t\t\tfiltering and sorting support, multi-database compatibility, and structured\n\t\t\tresponse models. Designed using Clean Architecture and Ports and Adapters\n\t\t\tprinciples to enable scalable integration across Web APIs, microservices,\n\t\t\tand modular enterprise systems.",
  "id": "ND.FW.GridComponent",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-02-17T15:08:46.617Z",
  "listed": true,
  "packageHash": "oVOwLKzCYQV536qjIKYoNBlzjqvLJuevhzRg33ZLqw9GIEv79mISDM62kdR29qYhTp9mlF3p45G0E5GhEBIVWQ==",
  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 68633,
  "published": "2026-02-17T15:06:42.827Z",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 0.0.3:\n\t\t\t- Initial release of ND Grid Component Framework\n\t\t\t- Support for five grid command types:\n\t\t\t• Simple Grid\n\t\t\t• Standard Grid\n\t\t\t• Advanced Grid\n\t\t\t• Work Queue Grid\n\t\t\t• Simple View-Only Grid\n\t\t\t- Metadata-driven grid configuration (Columns, Actions, Filters, Sorting)\n\t\t\t- Server-side pagination (Paged  Infinite Scroll support)\n\t\t\t- Advanced filtering and multi-column sorting capabilities\n\t\t\t- Multi-database provider support (SQL Server  PostgreSQL)\n\t\t\t- Stored procedure–based grid data retrieval architecture\n\t\t\t- Dynamic request/response models for flexible grid binding\n\t\t\t- Support for action metadata and grid-level permissions\n\t\t\t- Extensible adapter-based database provider implementation\n\t\t\t- Clean Architecture / Hexagonal Architecture compliant design\n\t\t\t- Correlation ID support for observability integration\n\t\t\t-CQRS pattern implementation for command handling and query processing With Dispatcher",
